<title>USA: US June S&amp;P 500s widen losses in low-volume trade.</title>
<headline>US June S&amp;P 500s widen losses in low-volume trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>April 21 - U.S. June S&amp;P 500s widened losses in low-volume trade, traders said. June fell to 758.50 due largely to computer-program selling, they said. Support is at 758.00 and 742.00, a trendline level. Further support is at 740.70, the 200-day moving average.</p>
